<%- include('partials/head') %><%- include('partials/nav') %><main class="container page-pad"><a class="back-link" href="/learn/<%= module.slug %>"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i> Kembali ke modul</a><div class="row g-5 align-items-start mt-1"><div class="col-lg-7"><span class="section-kicker">PRACTICE MODE</span><h1 class="mt-2">Latihan <%= module.title %></h1><p class="muted">Berlatih tanpa batas waktu. Kamu akan langsung melihat benar/salah dan penjelasan pada setiap jawaban. Sistem mengacak soal dan pilihan jawabannya.</p><div class="info-grid"><div><i class="bi bi-lightning"></i><strong>10 soal</strong><span>Maksimum per sesi</span></div><div><i class="bi bi-database"></i><strong><%= total %></strong><span>Bank soal aktif</span></div><div><i class="bi bi-chat-dots"></i><strong>Instant</strong><span>Pembahasan langsung</span></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-5"><div class="setup-panel"><h3>Pilih topik latihan</h3><p class="muted">Fokus satu submateri atau campur semua.</p><form action="/practice/<%= module.slug %>" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><div class="mb-4"><label class="form-label" for="lesson_id">Submateri</label><select id="lesson_id" class="form-select form-select-lg" name="lesson_id"><option value="all">Semua submateri (<%= total %> soal)</option><% lessons.forEach(l=>{ %><option value="<%= l.id %>" <%= selectedLesson===l.slug?'selected':'' %>><%= l.title %> (<%= l.count %> soal)</option><% }) %></select></div><button class="btn btn-brand btn-lg w-100" type="submit" <%= total===0?'disabled':'' %>>Mulai 10 Soal <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></button></form><div class="setup-note"><i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i> Urutan soal & opsi diacak. Jumlah aktual sesuai soal yang tersedia.</div></div></div></div></main><%- include('partials/footer') %>
